{% extends 'help/partials/base.html.twig' %}

{% set id = 'Scoreboard' %}

{% block header %}
    Scoreboard
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <p>
        You will find your results and those of the other participants on the Scoreboard page. The score for a solved
        problem equals the number of minutes since the start of the contest. Each unsuccessful attempt adds penalty
        time. Results are therefore sorted by the number of solved problems, highest first, and then by score, lowest
        first.
    </p>
    <p>
        The rows of the table are the participants and the columns are the problems. Each cell holds the participant's
        score on that problem (without penalty) and, below it, the number of attempts. The colour shows the state of
        the judging; see the legend in the bottom left corner. The "score" column holds the number of solved problems
        and the total score including penalty.
    </p>
    <img src="{{ asset('images/help/scoreboard.png') }}" alt="Scoreboard" class="mb-3 rounded-3 img-fluid help-img">
{% endblock %}
